 "Mark the changes seen under the action of M-cholinoblockers.",
 ["Mydriasis", "Dry mouth", "Tachycardia", "Reduced intestinal peristalsis", "Miosis", "Bronchospasm", "Increased sweating", "Bradycardia"],
 "Mioz, bronxospazm, ter ajralishi va bradikardiya — M-retseptorlar qo‘zg‘alishiga xos.",
